From 5a282cb43ef33f3d4b261e6202d83eca10571d1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NFCSTORE CI <ci@nfcstore.uz>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:34:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 60/69] Nova: xato kodlari video_uploads_disabled va
 moderation_unavailable
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

describeError endi ikkala server kodini (shartnoma §2) uch tilda
tushunarli matnga aylantiradi: video yuklash vaqtincha yopiq (rasm
yuklash mumkin) va avtomatik tekshiruv vaqtincha ishlamayapti.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
